caption: Space Adaptation
tradition-component: space-adaptation

A Spawn Master may purchase the following embodied survival traits directly without first discovering them through a Power Stunt. Every purchase remains fully point-paid and must have a plausible anatomical manifestation. These traits use the normal Spawn source rules when bought and may later become True Anatomy if their final construction is biologically intrinsic:

Doesn't Breathe.

Sealed.

Vacuum Support.

Temperature Tolerance.

Radiation Tolerance.

Doesn't Eat or Drink.

Doesn't Sleep.

Pressure Support.

For ordinary vacuum exposure, Doesn't Breathe addresses suffocation, Sealed protects against decompression injury, and Vacuum Support protects against the vacuum/explosive-decompression hazard. Temperature Tolerance and Radiation Tolerance address major environmental hazards of space. Doesn't Eat or Drink and Doesn't Sleep support long-duration biological independence, while Pressure Support covers high-pressure environments and decompression from them rather than vacuum itself.
